{"id":"n73671-1-7","stage":5,"title":"잠잠하다 · 平静","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73671-1-7-1","ko":"네 동생이 돈 좀 빌려 달라고 전화했어.","zh":"你妹妹打电话来，说要借点钱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"동생이","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생이","audio":"/audio/599230a656a3cfb2f54a.mp3"}},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려","audio":"/audio/67cc0fe84cbb6a7195bd.mp3"}},{"text":"달라고","meaning":"请求","explanation":"달다：请求；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62361","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달라고","audio":"/audio/352f999287f8651495b6.mp3"}},{"text":"전화했어.","meaning":"打电话，通话","explanation":"전화하다：打电话，通话；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"전화하다","audio":"/audio/aa1e3e09fae7e076a6a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70847","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화했어","audio":"/audio/ec4739bb62f8ebd3b892.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"请求","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"62361","definition":"听者为话者办理如前所述之事宜。","pronunciation":["달ː다"]},{"id":"aa1e3e09fae7e076","term":"전화하다","zh":"打电话，通话","audio":"/audio/aa1e3e09fae7e076a6a6.mp3","entryId":"70847","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈。","pronunciation":["전ː화하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bdefd5ad785612dd72b3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73671-1-7-2","ko":"아, 한동안 잠잠하더니 또 시작이군.","zh":"啊，本来有一阵子没动静了，又开始了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咳","explanation":"아：咳","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"3","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"한동안","meaning":"一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","explanation":"한동안：一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","readings":[{"term":"한동안","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72432","senseId":"1","lemma":"한동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한동안","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3"}},{"text":"잠잠하더니","meaning":"平静，寂静","explanation":"잠잠하다：平静，寂静；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"잠잠하다","audio":"/audio/406636e12b1e568ceee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73671","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠잠하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠잠하더니","audio":"/audio/294fbf2a9e638430ee5e.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"시작이군.","meaning":"开始，开端，开头，起始，起头","explanation":"시작：开始，开端，开头，起始，起头；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"시작","audio":"/audio/b1f28cd21af730b22ed3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36687","senseId":"1","lemma":"시작","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시작이군","audio":"/audio/47f893b03743fe936793.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咳","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到烦恼、担心、惋惜、叹息时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"9efbe5bbba69a9d5","term":"한동안","zh":"一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3","entryId":"72432","definition":"挺长的一段时间。","pronunciation":["한동안"]},{"id":"406636e12b1e568c","term":"잠잠하다","zh":"平静，寂静","audio":"/audio/406636e12b1e568ceee3.mp3","entryId":"73671","definition":"氛围或活动等不吵闹，很安静。","pronunciation":["잠잠하다"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","